{"title":"Career Roadmap — Experience Designer","role":"Experience Designer","summary":"An Experience Designer creates meaningful experiences across physical and digital environments. In exhibition, retail and spatial design, the role focuses on how people move through, interact with, understand and emotionally respond to a space or brand environment.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Exhibition / Retail / Spatial Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Experience Designer creates meaningful experiences across physical and digital environments. In exhibition, retail and spatial design, the role focuses on how people move through, interact with, understand and emotionally respond to a space or brand environment."},{"type":"h","text":"The work can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museums and exhibitions"},{"text":"Brand experiences"},{"text":"Retail stores"},{"text":"Pop-up experiences"},{"text":"Events and installations"},{"text":"Trade shows"},{"text":"Cultural exhibitions"},{"text":"Visitor centres"},{"text":"Experiential marketing"},{"text":"Immersive environments"},{"text":"Hospitality experiences"},{"text":"Public installations"},{"text":"Digital-physical experiences"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An Experience Designer combines spatial design, storytelling, user research, interaction design, visual communication, technology and brand strategy."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Exhibition / Retail / Spatial Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial + Experience Design Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Experience / Spatial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Director / Experience Strategy Director"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals + spatial thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Exhibition + retail + storytelling"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Experience design + interaction + technology"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Complex experiential projects + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Experience/Spatial Designer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Experience Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Experience Designer"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Experience Design Lead / Creative Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design & Spatial Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop fundamental design abilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design principles"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Sketching"},{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Spatial proportions"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Model-making"},{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Basic storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Exercises"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human movement"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Sightlines"},{"text":"Focal points"},{"text":"Spatial hierarchy"},{"text":"Thresholds"},{"text":"Public/private spaces"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Small Exhibition Installation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a 20–30 sq. metre exhibition concept."},{"type":"h","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Theme"},{"text":"Audience"},{"text":"Spatial layout"},{"text":"Visitor journey"},{"text":"Display elements"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Graphics"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Physical model"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Exhibition, Retail & Visitor Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Year 2 should introduce real-world experience design."},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition planning"},{"text":"Object placement"},{"text":"Display systems"},{"text":"Visitor circulation"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Signage"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Exhibition graphics"},{"text":"Story sequencing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Store zoning"},{"text":"Product presentation"},{"text":"Brand environments"},{"text":"Window displays"},{"text":"Interactive displays"},{"text":"Customer behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visitor Journey"},{"type":"h","text":"Entrance"},{"type":"h","text":"Orientation"},{"type":"h","text":"Discovery"},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction"},{"type":"h","text":"Engagement"},{"type":"h","text":"Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Emotional Peak"},{"type":"h","text":"Call to Action"},{"type":"h","text":"Exit"},{"type":"h","text":"Year-2 Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Experience Pop-Up"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a temporary brand space including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand story"},{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Spatial concept"},{"text":"Visitor journey"},{"text":"Interactive element"},{"text":"Product/display area"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Graphics"},{"text":"Exit/CTA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Experience Design & Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Year 3 should move beyond static spaces toward interactive experiences."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Experience mapping"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Service design"},{"text":"Behavioural design"},{"text":"Environmental psychology"},{"text":"Digital interaction"},{"text":"Immersive design"},{"text":"Storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the design possibilities of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Touchscreens"},{"text":"Projection mapping"},{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Interactive walls"},{"text":"Digital signage"},{"text":"AR"},{"text":"VR"},{"text":"Mixed reality"},{"text":"Spatial audio"},{"text":"Motion tracking"},{"text":"LED installations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The designer does not need to become a hardware engineer, but should understand how technology can improve the experience."}]},{"heading":"Experience Design Process","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A professional workflow can look like:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience Understanding"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Goal"},{"type":"h","text":"Journey Mapping"},{"type":"h","text":"Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Storytelling"},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype"},{"type":"h","text":"User Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Iteration"},{"type":"h","text":"Installation"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"The central question is:"},{"type":"p","text":"What should the visitor feel, understand and do at each stage of the experience?"}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Advanced Experiential Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Year 4 should demonstrate professional-level project capability."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experiential branding"},{"text":"Immersive environments"},{"text":"Exhibition strategy"},{"text":"Retail experience"},{"text":"Event experience"},{"text":"Museum experience"},{"text":"Spatial storytelling"},{"text":"Interactive installations"},{"text":"Digital-physical experiences"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Sustainable exhibition design"},{"text":"Experience measurement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"h","text":"A strong project could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Immersive Future Museum\""},{"type":"p","text":"Design an exhibition where visitors explore a topic through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical installations"},{"text":"Interactive displays"},{"text":"Projection"},{"text":"Sound"},{"text":"Physical artefacts"},{"text":"Digital information"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Spatial storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the complete visitor journey from entrance to exit."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Exhibition Experience"},{"text":"Visitor journey + storytelling"}],[{"text":"Museum Experience"},{"text":"Interpretation + interaction"}],[{"text":"Retail Experience"},{"text":"Brand + customer journey"}],[{"text":"Brand Experience"},{"text":"Branding + spatial design"}],[{"text":"Event Experience"},{"text":"Temporary environments"}],[{"text":"Immersive Experience"},{"text":"AR/VR + interactive environments"}],[{"text":"Experiential Marketing"},{"text":"Brand activation"}],[{"text":"Cultural Experience"},{"text":"Museums + cultural spaces"}],[{"text":"Hospitality Experience"},{"text":"Hotels + restaurants"}],[{"text":"Public Experience"},{"text":"Civic/public environments"}],[{"text":"Digital-Physical Experience"},{"text":"Physical + digital interaction"}],[{"text":"Installation Design"},{"text":"Art + spatial interaction"}]]}]},{"heading":"Software & Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"Blender"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enscape"},{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Lumion"},{"text":"Twinmotion"},{"text":"KeyShot"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Graphic Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"InDesign"},{"text":"Figma"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Mapping"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Miro"},{"text":"FigJam"},{"text":"Notion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Prototyping"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unity"},{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"TouchDesigner"},{"text":"ProtoPie"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The student should aim for:"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAD","3D","Rendering","Visual Design","Experience Mapping","Interactive Prototyping"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Experience Designer's portfolio should demonstrate how an audience experiences the space, not merely how the space looks."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Museum Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Visitor persona"},{"text":"Story structure"},{"text":"Floor plan"},{"text":"Visitor journey"},{"text":"Display system"},{"text":"Graphics"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Final renders"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Retail Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Store journey"},{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Brand interaction"},{"text":"Display"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Post-purchase experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Immersive Installation"},{"type":"h","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Light"},{"text":"Sound"},{"text":"Projection"},{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Brand Pop-Up"},{"type":"h","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand strategy"},{"text":"Spatial identity"},{"text":"Visitor interaction"},{"text":"Social-media moments"},{"text":"Product engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Public/Cultural Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Solve a real social or cultural communication problem through an exhibition or installation."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Final-Year Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete physical/digital experience prototype."}]},{"heading":"Strong Portfolio Structure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Each project should follow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Context"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Goal"},{"type":"h","text":"Journey Map"},{"type":"h","text":"Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype"},{"type":"h","text":"Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Impact / Learnings"},{"type":"p","text":"This is much stronger than showing only final renders."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition design studios"},{"text":"Experiential design agencies"},{"text":"Retail design firms"},{"text":"Museum design studios"},{"text":"Brand experience agencies"},{"text":"Event agencies"},{"text":"Spatial design studios"},{"text":"Architecture/interior design firms"},{"text":"Immersive technology companies"},{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"Advertising agencies with experiential teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experience Design Intern"},{"text":"Spatial Design Intern"},{"text":"Exhibition Design Intern"},{"text":"Retail Design Intern"},{"text":"Experiential Design Intern"},{"text":"Brand Experience Intern"},{"text":"Museum Design Intern"},{"text":"Event Experience Intern"},{"text":"Interaction Design Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"\"Brand Experience Pop-Up\""},{"type":"p","text":"During the internship, aim to contribute to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Visitor Journey"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Layout"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Touchpoints"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Fabrication"},{"type":"h","text":"Installation"},{"type":"h","text":"Visitor Feedback"},{"type":"p","text":"Being involved in fabrication and installation is particularly valuable because it teaches the difference between a concept and a buildable experience."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition design"},{"text":"Spatial design"},{"text":"Experience design"},{"text":"Service design"},{"text":"UX design"},{"text":"Retail design"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Event design"},{"text":"Environmental psychology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates should support actual projects rather than replace portfolio development."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Experience Designer"},{"text":"Experience Designer"},{"text":"Spatial Designer"},{"text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"text":"Retail Experience Designer"},{"text":"Brand Experience Designer"},{"text":"Experiential Designer"},{"text":"Museum Experience Designer"},{"text":"Event Experience Designer"},{"text":"Installation Designer"},{"text":"Environmental Graphic Designer"},{"text":"Immersive Experience Designer"},{"text":"Visitor Experience Designer"},{"text":"Experience Strategist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Experience Designer"},{"text":"Experience Design Lead"},{"text":"Creative Lead"},{"text":"Experience Strategy Lead"},{"text":"Creative Director"}]}]},{"heading":"Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is experience design?"},{"text":"How is experience design different from interior design?"},{"text":"How would you design a museum visitor journey?"},{"text":"How do you define a successful experience?"},{"text":"How do you design for different visitor types?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How do you plan visitor circulation?"},{"text":"How do you create a focal point?"},{"text":"How does lighting affect an experience?"},{"text":"How would you design an accessible exhibition?"},{"text":"How do you balance aesthetics with functionality?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"When should technology be used in an experience?"},{"text":"How would you design an interactive installation?"},{"text":"How would you prototype an interactive experience?"},{"text":"How do you prevent technology from becoming a distraction?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain your best experience-design project."},{"text":"What was the intended visitor journey?"},{"text":"What did your research reveal?"},{"text":"How did testing change your design?"},{"text":"What would you improve in the next iteration?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant postgraduate pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Des in Experience Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Interaction Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Spatial Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Exhibition Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Service Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Strategic Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Exhibition Design"},{"text":"Immersive Media"},{"text":"Digital Experience Design"},{"text":"Environmental Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experience Management"},{"text":"Brand Management"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Event Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a hands-on designer, experience, interaction, spatial or service design is generally more directly aligned than a general management programme."}]},{"heading":"High-Value Specialist Routes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Route A — Museum Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Spatial Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Route B — Brand Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Experiential Design Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Route C — Immersive Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial + Interaction Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Unity / Unreal / TouchDesigner"},{"type":"h","text":"Immersive Design Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Immersive Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Immersive Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Technology / Experience Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Route D — Retail Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Journey"},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Retail Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Strategy Lead"}]},{"heading":"Accessibility & Inclusive Experience","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional Experience Designer should design for different abilities and needs."},{"type":"h","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wheelchair accessibility"},{"text":"Clear circulation"},{"text":"Readable typography"},{"text":"Colour contrast"},{"text":"Audio alternatives"},{"text":"Tactile experiences"},{"text":"Multilingual information"},{"text":"Different heights and reach ranges"},{"text":"Sensory sensitivities"},{"text":"Clear navigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The goal is:"},{"type":"p","text":"More people should be able to understand and participate in the experience independently."}]},{"heading":"Sustainability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Exhibitions and experiential installations often have short lifecycles, making sustainability especially important."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Modular exhibition systems"},{"text":"Reusable structures"},{"text":"Recyclable materials"},{"text":"Low-waste fabrication"},{"text":"Energy-efficient lighting"},{"text":"Digital alternatives where appropriate"},{"text":"Material lifecycle planning"},{"text":"Local fabrication"},{"text":"Design for disassembly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"A strong portfolio project could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Reusable Modular Exhibition System\""},{"type":"p","text":"designed to adapt to multiple exhibitions rather than being discarded after one event."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Experience Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI and emerging technology will increasingly influence experience design."},{"type":"h","text":"Students should explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-generated experience concepts"},{"text":"Personalised visitor journeys"},{"text":"Generative environments"},{"text":"AR experiences"},{"text":"VR experiences"},{"text":"AI-powered interactive characters"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Sensor-based interaction"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"Real-time data-driven installations"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Adaptive environments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Experience Designer","Spatial Designer","Interaction Designer","Creative Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI should enhance the experience rather than be added simply because it is technologically impressive."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Directions","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experience Design"},{"text":"Spatial Design"},{"text":"Exhibition Design"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Immersive Media"},{"text":"Environmental Design"},{"text":"Museum/Curatorial Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential destinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Denmark"},{"text":"Sweden"},{"text":"Finland"},{"text":"Italy"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Japan"}]},{"type":"p","text":"When comparing programmes, prioritise studio projects, fabrication facilities, industry partnerships, exhibition opportunities and access to emerging interaction technologies."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Graduate"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative path:"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Strategist"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Lead"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Spatial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Visitor circulation"},{"text":"Exhibition design"},{"text":"Retail design"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Installation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Behavioural design"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Service design"},{"text":"Prototyping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"SketchUp/Rhino"},{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Adobe Creative Suite"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Unity/Unreal or TouchDesigner"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Fabrication coordination"},{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"User testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"AI-assisted design"},{"text":"Creative coding"},{"text":"Sensor-based interaction"},{"text":"Digital-physical experiences"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile should look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Exhibition/Retail/Spatial Design","Experience Mapping","Spatial Design","Exhibition/Retail Expertise","3D/CAD","Rendering","Interaction Design","Storytelling","Interactive Technology","4–6 Experience Projects","Internship","Strong Experience Portfolio"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 1","text":"Spatial fundamentals + visual storytelling\nYear 2: Exhibition/retail + visitor experience\nYear 3: Interaction + immersive technology + prototyping\nYear 4: Major experiential project + internship + professional portfolio\nAfter graduation: Junior Experience/Spatial Designer\n3–5 years: Experience Designer\n5–8 years: Senior Experience Designer / Experience Lead\n8+ years: Creative Director / Experience Strategy Director"},{"type":"note","label":"Key point","text":"The strongest candidate is not simply someone who can design an attractive space. They can research the audience, define the intended experience, map the visitor journey, design the physical environment, integrate meaningful interactions, prototype and test the experience, and translate the concept into a buildable real-world installation."}]}]}